{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_69cb42c1483cd3487995e0efe9bc10b74be112b42a1b396d4e0c857600b4473d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"New sessions use Pi's Bash resolver rather than ambient $SHELL/COMSPEC; on Windows it discovers Git Bash, and legacy WSL stdin-only bash is rejected for interactive PTYs."}],"claim_ids":["clm_69cb42c1483cd3487995e0efe9bc10b74be112b42a1b396d4e0c857600b4473d"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7aa9fb36424be4ae3cb9fc32a86a85","id":"pg_320ca89cc63c5e6f803259c34a794ed5","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/nicobailon-pi-interactive-shell-changelog-md-eedb89a9e461-59c34a794ed5.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cc69fba9f22550818922d12ae768d48d"],"title":"nicobailon/pi-interactive-shell/CHANGELOG.md @ eedb89a9e461","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3d7aa9fb36424be4ae3cb9fc32a86a85"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_074fee30f64bceecf5b2e5c83917cc58bb26a20a47ca2ecd7c8944dcc6eabb63"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A `defer: true` config keeps the large tool definition out of the initial model request, exposing a small `enable_interactive_shell` loader instead; slash commands and shortcuts still work directly."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2c87f52274ec31bfb8fcc61261fd7d30f4eee95553754ebed60519e9f13cb0ce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Dispatch defaults autoExitOnQuiet with a 15s startup grace period and 8s silence threshold; both are configurable per-call or globally via autoExitGracePeriod."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3c9c0a731bac803aa1cd563b081ff32ec90b3ca6afd77f741193c32e839f41a4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Monitor mode wakes the agent on configured trigger events (stream, poll-diff, or file-watch strategies) with structured payloads, plus lifecycle notifications when the monitor stops."},{"claim_ids":["clm_49674c3b4e1baf74032b4badf3ed1990ec5c053b89fa8698a8f450b84323c285"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Structured spawn params can launch coding agents (pi, codex, claude, cursor) with prompts, worktree isolation, and a Pi-only fork mode; extra spawn.commands keys become first-class custom agents."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4e971df15d4055f94e9f1c1a842c03971e817f966d08d111b84f2719ed7a4fa4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the README's example workflow templates are opt-in user-facing prompts to copy into agent config, not contributor contribution rules; no contributor/CI guidance appears in the provided slices."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5bd135e3ba8c5868b922e22de54e5891075bbc9d278e993dabe543b05f0a2f59"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions return a stable sessionId; the agent can send input with submit, named keys, bracketed paste, or raw hex bytes, and query status/output."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5d8555772a36c07ef10408e11a94fba56a15cd188864f5cd7dbb1ac84442a203"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The extension exposes an `interactive_shell` tool for the Pi coding agent; end users do not call it directly but ask Pi in natural language or use /spawn, /attach, /dismiss commands."},{"claim_ids":["clm_69cb42c1483cd3487995e0efe9bc10b74be112b42a1b396d4e0c857600b4473d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"New sessions use Pi's Bash resolver rather than ambient $SHELL/COMSPEC; on Windows it discovers Git Bash, and legacy WSL stdin-only bash is rejected for interactive PTYs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7367b0209f2dcfe6aeb3e1271efbfcc7170930c9c64079dca0effb754b4aa6dd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool supports four modes: interactive (default), hands-free, dispatch, and monitor, all returning immediately without the agent waiting."},{"claim_ids":["clm_adf54e6f4690db7e13846e00500489c175c3b374dc4a8d8ac1f185b51751daa9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented limitations: macOS tested with Linux experimental, a 60-second rate limit between agent queries (configurable), and possible rendering quirks in some TUI apps."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c2d852a107076826a4d398f6162bdb676474ea38110c6110a27687450522be30"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Architecture: interactive_shell routes through zigpty to the subprocess, with xterm-headless terminal emulation feeding a TUI overlay rendered by Pi; the subprocess gets a full PTY."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c91e9785ab38a9075df0b12ba95110d38c57e841fb00f5b0266d9f3e8f5cbe8e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Dispatch mode notifies the agent via triggerTurn on completion with a 5-line output tail; the PTY is preserved for 5 minutes so the agent can attach and review scrollback."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d790b1ad1adc33da6dc551d3386d6bc8ca4f2d289ae26acd30ea050a16686b6d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions can be backgrounded by user (Ctrl+B/Ctrl+Q) or agent, listed via listBackground, reattached with a chosen mode, and dismissed individually or all at once."},{"claim_ids":["clm_df0a9b46edefb4a0ce689320cfc35b36ee555a17b454ec941136911b51e7aa3e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Output queries default to 20 lines/5KB, support up to 200 lines, incremental pagination, and a raw drain mode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ed9c0cf977a6dc33ea7dc07a8fb06c2cb290d8fb658303a44b3ce3e7b8c684f2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installation symlinks an interactive-shell skill into ~/.pi/agent/skills/, and optional example skills (codex-cli, cursor-cli, prompting skills) and prompt templates ship under examples/ for opt-in copy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fe6973e4d1a0b30b0a315b5696d76048b124b21c81e61a4dca2cd7fa07a8eed9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Requires Node.js; PTY support uses prebuilt zigpty binaries, so no node-gyp toolchain is needed on supported platforms."}],"claim_ids":["clm_074fee30f64bceecf5b2e5c83917cc58bb26a20a47ca2ecd7c8944dcc6eabb63","clm_2c87f52274ec31bfb8fcc61261fd7d30f4eee95553754ebed60519e9f13cb0ce","clm_3c9c0a731bac803aa1cd563b081ff32ec90b3ca6afd77f741193c32e839f41a4","clm_49674c3b4e1baf74032b4badf3ed1990ec5c053b89fa8698a8f450b84323c285","clm_4e971df15d4055f94e9f1c1a842c03971e817f966d08d111b84f2719ed7a4fa4","clm_5bd135e3ba8c5868b922e22de54e5891075bbc9d278e993dabe543b05f0a2f59","clm_5d8555772a36c07ef10408e11a94fba56a15cd188864f5cd7dbb1ac84442a203","clm_69cb42c1483cd3487995e0efe9bc10b74be112b42a1b396d4e0c857600b4473d","clm_7367b0209f2dcfe6aeb3e1271efbfcc7170930c9c64079dca0effb754b4aa6dd","clm_adf54e6f4690db7e13846e00500489c175c3b374dc4a8d8ac1f185b51751daa9","clm_c2d852a107076826a4d398f6162bdb676474ea38110c6110a27687450522be30","clm_c91e9785ab38a9075df0b12ba95110d38c57e841fb00f5b0266d9f3e8f5cbe8e","clm_d790b1ad1adc33da6dc551d3386d6bc8ca4f2d289ae26acd30ea050a16686b6d","clm_df0a9b46edefb4a0ce689320cfc35b36ee555a17b454ec941136911b51e7aa3e","clm_ed9c0cf977a6dc33ea7dc07a8fb06c2cb290d8fb658303a44b3ce3e7b8c684f2","clm_fe6973e4d1a0b30b0a315b5696d76048b124b21c81e61a4dca2cd7fa07a8eed9"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_3d7aa9fb36424be4ae3cb9fc32a86a85","id":"pg_d7ee6bb1bd485a41a2cfae346c38f674","maturity":"dr